  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2508,
      "text": "“We never sent before you [O Prophet] any messenger without revealing to him that none has the right to be worshiped except Me, so worship Me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2509,
      "text": "They say, “The Most Compassionate has begotten offspring!”[13] Glory be to Him! In fact, those [angels] are His honored slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2510,
      "text": "They do not speak before He speaks, and they only do as He commands.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2511,
      "text": "He knows what is ahead of them and what is behind them[14]. They cannot intercede except for whom He pleases, and they are fearful in awe of Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2512,
      "text": "If anyone of them were to say, “I am god besides Him,” We would punish him with Hell. This is how We punish the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2513,
      "text": "Are the disbelievers not aware that the heavens and earth were joined together and then We split them apart? We created from water every living thing. Will they not then believe?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2514,
      "text": "We have set on the earth firm mountains so it does not shake with them, and We have made therein broad pathways so that they may find their way.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2515,
      "text": "And We have made the sky a well-protected canopy, yet they turn away from its signs[15].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2516,
      "text": "It is He Who created the night and the day, the sun and the moon – each floating in its orbit.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2517,
      "text": "We did not grant immortality to any human being before you [O Prophet]. So if you die, will they live forever?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 324,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2518,
      "text": "Every soul will taste death; We test you with bad and good as a trial, then to Us you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
